rney. Optibus Achieves Gold EcoVadis Medal 2023 for Sustainability Excellence With a notable score of 70/100, we’ve earned the esteemed Gold EcoVadis Medal, placing us among the top 5 percent of companies assessed on our first attempt. This recognition underscores our commitment to environmental, social, and governance (ESG) practices. Grateful for our stakeholders’ contributions, Optibus remains dedicated to shaping a future of responsible corporate standards. Environmental Initiatives Sustainable Practices Environmental Committee Our Environmental Committee is instrumental in implementing sustainable practices based on our internal sustainability report. Our goals include reducing our carbon footprint, utilizing renewable energy, and promoting sustainable practices. We proudly share that our product emissions have been powered by renewable sources since 2021. You can find our carbon reduction plan here . Monitoring, Analyzing, and Reducing Emissions​ Scope 1 Our product emissions - 100% renewable Incorporating renewable energy into our products, we focus on Scope 1 emissions. Future objectives include ongoing partnerships with 100% renewable energy sources and clear data optimization guidelines aligned with the GHG protocol emission guidelines. Scope 2 and Scope 3 Sustainable travel as priority Our efforts extend to office utility, business travel, and commuting, with a reduction of our CO2 consumption in the travel sector by more than 10% from 2022 to 2023. Sustainable Operations, Office Management, Waste Reduction Our commitment to sustainability extends to daily operations, office management, and waste reduction. From foot and bicycle deliveries to partnerships with NGOs like \"Social Green,\" promoting sustainability, providing employment opportunities to people with disabilities, and sharing valuable recycling data. Our practices reflect a dedication to environmental stewardship.​ Fostering Social Sustainability at Optibus Social Committee Led by Hilla Porat 