 public transportation? Help us to celebrate the unsung heroes driving positive change in public transportation – whether as drivers, passengers, planners, or innovators. If someone’s actions are making public transportation better for everyone, we want to share their story. Questions? Contact us at marketing@optibus.com for more info. See the power of Optibus for yourself Request A Demo Get transportation industry updates Product Planning Scheduling Roster Operations Driver App Passenger Information MagicEye – Driver Safety Control & Monitoring Optibus Agent Planning Scheduling Roster Operations Driver App Passenger Information MagicEye – Driver Safety Control & Monitoring Optibus Agent Solutions By Organization Public Transportation Agencies Public Transportation Consultancies Public Transportation Operators By Use Case Tenders Electric Vehicles fleet management Software Enhance Passenger Experience Reduce Costs Driver Retention By Organization Public Transportation Agencies Public Transportation Consultancies Public Transportation Operators By Use Case Tenders Electric Vehicles fleet management Software Enhance Passenger Experience Reduce Costs Driver Retention Resources Blog eBooks Webinars Case Studies Videos Blog eBooks Webinars Case Studies Videos Company About Contact Us Careers Media Security Upcoming Events Partnership Program Academy Program Sustainability & ESG Hero Award Mobility Hub About Contact Us Careers Media Security Upcoming Events Partnership Program Academy Program Sustainability & ESG Hero Award Mobility Hub info@optibus.com Privacy Policy Accessibility Statement Cookies Policy ISO 27001:2022 certified Sub-processors List © Optibus 2026 Linkedin-in Facebook-f Twitter Youtube Optibus English Português Brasil Português Portugal Français Deutsch Español América Latina Español Europa Italiano Our Company About Careers Media Security Events Contact Partnership Program Academy Program Sustainability & ESG Hero Award Mobility HUB Optibus AI Our Resou